ge onto the central ion trap region (x ~ 350-390 mm, y ~ 330-350 mm), modeled by three closely spaced wide-aperture detector ports (TRAP, TRAP_W, TRAP_E) facing the three incoming beam directions (-135 deg, 0 deg, and 180 deg). Four pickoff samplers (S_690, S_422, S_1092, S_984) tap 10% of the trap lasers and route them alongside the Rb-stabilized 782 nm reference laser to the Transfer Cavity (TC, TC_N, TC_E) at the bottom of the baseplate."}, "report": {"passed": false, "score": 0.0, "checks": [{"id": "stray_beam", "severity": "error", "message": "laser safety: unterminated beam on L_422.t.r.0.t (2.43 mW) leaves the table from (90,497) at 180\u00b0; add a beam dump", "element_id": null, "segment_id": "s18", "value": 2.4299999999999207, "limit": 0.5}, {"id": "stray_beam", "severity": "warning", "message": "weak unterminated beam on L_422.t.r.0.r (0.270 mW)", "element_id": null, "segment_id": "s19", "value": 0.2699999999999912, "limit": 0.05}, {"id": "stray_beam", "severity": "error", "message": "laser safety: unterminated beam on L_422.t.r.+1.t (9.72 mW) leaves the table from (91,496) at -180\u00b0; add a beam dump", "element_id": null, "segment_id": "s22", "value": 9.719999999999686, "limit": 0.5}, {"id": "stray_beam", "severity": "error", "message": "laser safety: unterminated beam on L_422.t.r.+1.r (1.08 mW) leaves the table from (91,496) at 90\u00b0; add a beam dump", "element_id": null, "segment_id": "s23", "value": 1.0799999999999652, "limit": 0.5}, {"id": "stray_beam", "severity": "error", "message": "laser safety: unterminated beam on L_984.t.+1.t (10.80 mW) leaves the table from (614,335) at 179\u00b0; add a beam dump", "element_id": null, "segment_id": "s33", "value": 10.799961387274251, "limit": 0.5}, {"id": "stray_beam", "severity": "error", "message": "laser safety: unterminated beam on L_1092.t.r.0.t (3.24 mW) leaves the table from (683,70) at -90\u00b0; add a beam dump", "element_id": null, "segment_id": "s41", "value": 3.239999812194563, "limit": 0.5